{
  "name": "16 · Invoice to GST Register (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Finance)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 16 · Invoice → GST Register\nPurchase bill PDF → AI GSTIN, invoice no, taxable value, CGST/SGST/IGST nikaalta hai → GST register sheet. Code GSTIN format aur total check karta hai; gadbad ho to owner ko flag.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **GST purchases**.\n2. AI model: **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n3. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID). Replace YOUR_CA_WHATSAPP.\n\nAlways reconcile with GSTR-2B before claiming ITC.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "35b41220-a5d4-4f49-8761-98a24916c94c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Purchase invoice → GST register",
        "formDescription": "Staff only. One invoice PDF per upload.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Client",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Invoice",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "acceptFileTypes": ".pdf",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1d8c261-a625-43bb-9b7a-4708a95d816e",
      "name": "Upload invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "Invoice",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f53bc36a-07c2-4657-b9cf-1b237964b296",
      "name": "Read PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Invoice text:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nExtract exactly what is printed (no guessing): supplier_name, supplier_gstin, invoice_no, invoice_date (yyyy-mm-dd), place_of_supply, taxable_value, cgst, sgst, igst, total (numbers, 0 if absent). Use null if a field is not on the invoice.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "7a586389-28c1-4c0e-a9c0-a5cd57564005",
      "name": "AI reads invoice",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "d94c6eeb-0cb2-4bb8-be7a-357f311264c0",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        440,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"supplier_name\": \"Raj Traders\",\n  \"supplier_gstin\": \"36ABCDE1234F1Z5\",\n  \"invoice_no\": \"RT/118\",\n  \"invoice_date\": \"2026-09-03\",\n  \"place_of_supply\": \"Telangana\",\n  \"taxable_value\": 15593.22,\n  \"cgst\": 1403.39,\n  \"sgst\": 1403.39,\n  \"igst\": 0,\n  \"total\": 18400\n}"
      },
      "id": "adefc709-c299-4e47-8988-d4979b2c7508",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        640,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const v = $json.output;\nconst issues = [];\nif (!/^[0-9]{2}[A-Z]{5}[0-9]{4}[A-Z][1-9A-Z]Z[0-9A-Z]$/.test(v.supplier_gstin || '')) issues.push('GSTIN format wrong/missing');\nconst sum = Number(v.taxable_value) + Number(v.cgst) + Number(v.sgst) + Number(v.igst);\nif (Math.abs(sum - Number(v.total)) > 1) issues.push(`total mismatch (${sum.toFixed(2)} vs ${v.total})`);\nif (Number(v.igst) > 0 && (Number(v.cgst) > 0 || Number(v.sgst) > 0)) issues.push('IGST and CGST/SGST both present');\nreturn { json: { Client: $('Upload invoice').item.json.Client, Supplier: v.supplier_name, GSTIN: v.supplier_gstin, 'Invoice no': v.invoice_no,\n  Date: v.invoice_date, POS: v.place_of_supply, Taxable: v.taxable_value, CGST: v.cgst, SGST: v.sgst, IGST: v.igst, Total: v.total,\n  Check: issues.length ? issues.join('; ') : 'OK', ok: !issues.length } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "340bb01f-f4a0-4ada-8a20-241b1adc0aba",
      "name": "GSTIN + maths check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "GST purchases"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5fe06183-e7d8-4467-ac8e-33359b5b959a",
      "name": "GST purchase register",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        980,
